  "notes": "A compound verb: {投|な}げる (to throw) + {込|こ}む (into). The {込|こ}む element adds the directional meaning of entering a space.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: XをYに{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (throw X into Y)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{投|な}げ{込|こ}んでいる can mean either 'is in the act of throwing in' or 'has thrown in (and it's still there).'\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ゴミを{箱|はこ}に{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (to toss garbage into the bin)\n- {手紙|てがみ}をポストに{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (to drop a letter in the mailbox)\n- {石|いし}を{池|いけ}に{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (to throw stones into a pond)\n\nRELATED 〜{込|こ}む VERBS:\n- {飛|と}び{込|こ}む (to jump into)\n- {駆|か}け{込|こ}む (to rush into)\n- {迷|まよ}い{込|こ}む (to wander into)",
